  "prefLabel": "Ins 5001.05 Rules Applicable to All Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 5001.05 Rules Applicable to All Applications. All applications that are attached to a policy and become part of the policy shall be submitted for review under RSA 412:5 and shall comply with the following:\n\n(a) The declarative portion of the application, if any, shall consist of representations of facts made to the best of the applicant’s knowledge; and\n\n(b) No provision shall be permitted in an application that changes the terms of the policy to which it is attached.\n\nSource. #12770, eff 5-5-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins5000.html"
}
